[notice]Do not paste passwords, SNMP communities, API keys or other credentials into the forum.[/notice]

Before posting, normally try:
[code]Switch Vision Installer → Update All → restart Home Assistant Core when requested → run Discovery again[/code]
If the problem remains, preserve the broken state long enough to collect useful diagnostics.
